# Architecture Patterns

## Services
- **MidiService**: Handles all MIDI I/O. Uses MIDIKit. `@MainActor` isolated.
- **BluetoothMidiManager**: Scans/Connects BLE peripherals. ObservableObject.
- **AudioMonitorService**: Local audio synthesis. Thread-safe (no locks/classes in render block).

## Audio Engine
- **AVAudioSourceNode**: Use for synthesis to avoid obscure SoundFont deps.
- **Real-time Safety**: 
  - NO `NSLock` or Swift Classes in render block.
  - Use `UnsafeMutablePointer<VoiceData>` for shared state.
  - Capture constants locally before entering block.

## Data Flow
- **Bluetooth -> MIDI**: Connect logic separate from Note sending.
- **UI -> Service**: View triggers `midiService.sendNoteOn` & `audioMonitor.playNote`.
- **Polyphony**: Max 16 voices. Round-robin or linear search allocation.
